  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "星穹召唤 · Astral Summon",
      "text": "**一款 DeepSeek Harness（dsh）插件：二次元抽卡 + 和你抽到的角色聊天**\n**A DeepSeek Harness (dsh) plugin: anime gacha cards you can actually talk to**\n\n[中文](#中文) · [English](#english)\n\n</div>\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "这是什么",
      "text": "跑在 dsh Web 版里的抽卡小游戏。204 位角色，每位都有自己的人设和说话习惯，抽到谁就能和谁聊天。\n\n- 🎴 **抽卡**：单抽 / 十连，SSR 带金色开卡演出。\n- 💬 **聊天**：单聊，或拉 2～4 位角色的群聊；「消息」页里随时接着聊。\n- 🎁 **星辉石**：开局 16000（100 抽），每聊完一轮再送 160（1 抽）。\n- 🔒 **不碰密钥**：用你在 dsh 里配好的模型，插件不读取、不保存任何 API key。"
    },
    {
      "section": "概率",
      "text": "| 稀有度 | 卡数 | 概率 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| SSR | 29 | 1% |\n| SR | 64 | 10% |\n| R | 111 | 89% |\n\n同稀有度内每张卡概率均等。连续 99 抽没出 SSR，第 100 抽必出；没有 SR 保底。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "需要 **Node.js 20+**、**pnpm**，以及用 npm 装好的 dsh（`npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh`）。已在 dsh 0.2.1 上测试，旧版 dsh 先升级：`npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh@latest`。\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:stargacha/stargacha-\ndsh web\n```\n\n打开 dsh，点左侧边栏的「星穹召唤」。聊天用你在 dsh 设置里选的模型，插件本身不用配置。"
    },
    {
      "section": "更新",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web update dsh-astral-summon\n```\n\n备用（上面没拉到新版时，直接覆盖重装）：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:stargacha/stargacha-\n```\n\n更新后重启 `dsh web`。存档在浏览器里，不会丢。以前用 git clone 装的，进文件夹 `git pull` 再重启就行。"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私",
      "text": "- 存档和聊天记录只存在你浏览器的 localStorage 里。\n- 唯一的联网动作是经 dsh 把人设和聊天记录发给你选的模型，不连其他服务器。\n- 接口默认只响应本机；确实要开放到局域网，设 `ASTRAL_SUMMON_ALLOW_REMOTE=1`。\n- 源码全部明文，未混淆、未压缩。"
    },
    {
      "section": "自己写角色",
      "text": "1. 照 `personas/SCHEMA.md` 写 `personas/astral-XX.json`。\n2. 卡面放进 `game/girl_XX.jpg`，在 `game/index.html` 的 `CARDS` 里加一条，`rarity` 填 `\"SSR\"`、`\"SR\"` 或 `\"R\"`（和人设文件一致）。\n3. 重新 `plugin add`，重启 dsh。"
    },
    {
      "section": "已知限制",
      "text": "- 只支持 dsh **Web 版**；存档在本地，不防作弊；dsh 升级后插件可能要跟着调整。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "[PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0](LICENSE)：可自由学习、修改和非商业使用，**禁止商用**。部分角色形象另有授权，复用图片前请看 [CREDITS.md](CREDITS.md)。本项目与 DeepSeek 官方无关。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "What is it",
      "text": "A gacha mini-game inside the dsh Web UI. 204 characters, each with her own persona and voice. Pull a card, then chat with her.\n\n- 🎴 **Pulls**: single / 10-pull, golden reveal for SSRs.\n- 💬 **Chat**: one-on-one or group chats with 2–4 of your cards; pick up any chat from the Messages tab.\n- 🎁 **Star Stones**: 16,000 to start (100 pulls), plus 160 (1 pull) for each finished chat round.\n- 🔒 **No keys touched**: chat uses the model set up in dsh; the plugin never reads or stores API keys."
    },
    {
      "section": "Rates",
      "text": "| Rarity | Cards | Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| SSR | 29 | 1% |\n| SR | 64 | 10% |\n| R | 111 | 89% |\n\nCards within a rarity share its rate evenly. 99 pulls without an SSR guarantees one on the 100th; no SR pity."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires **Node.js 20+**, **pnpm**, and dsh installed with npm (`npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh`). Tested on dsh 0.2.1; upgrade older dsh with `npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh@latest`.\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:stargacha/stargacha-\ndsh web\n```\n\nOpen dsh and click **星穹召唤** in the sidebar. Chat uses the model selected in dsh; the plugin needs no setup."
    },
    {
      "section": "Update",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web update dsh-astral-summon\n```\n\nFallback (if that didn't fetch the new version, reinstall over it):\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:stargacha/stargacha-\n```\n\nThen restart `dsh web`. Your save lives in the browser and is kept. If you installed with git clone before, run `git pull` in that folder and restart."
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy",
      "text": "- Saves and chat history stay in your browser's localStorage.\n- The only network call sends persona + chat history to your chosen model through dsh.\n- Endpoints answer localhost only; set `ASTRAL_SUMMON_ALLOW_REMOTE=1` to expose them on a LAN.\n- All source is plain and unminified."
    },
    {
      "section": "Writing your own character",
      "text": "See `personas/SCHEMA.md`, add `game/girl_XX.jpg` and a `CARDS` entry in `game/index.html` (with `rarity`), then re-run `plugin add`."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0](LICENSE): free for noncommercial use and modification, **no commercial use**. Some character designs carry their own terms; see [CREDITS.md](CREDITS.md). Not affiliated with DeepSeek."
    }
